WEBVTT

00:15.930 --> 00:18.680
<i>Huh? What the hell is this?</i>

00:19.640 --> 00:21.060
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:21.770 --> 00:24.520
<i>Their opponents are Team V, the strongest team.</i>

00:25.270 --> 00:27.820
<i>And what's more, they're down to 10 players.</i>

00:28.650 --> 00:30.190
<i>This has to be a joke.</i>

00:30.780 --> 00:32.950
<i>Or are they actually</i>

00:35.160 --> 00:37.580
<i>going to win?</i>

02:14.050 --> 02:17.630
What the hell are you guys doing?
Put in some effort, you idiots!

02:17.720 --> 02:21.970
Aren't you ashamed of losing
against 10 players?

02:24.180 --> 02:26.100
Shut up, you piece of trash.

02:30.480 --> 02:34.280
<i>I won't become someone
who couldn't realize their dream.</i>

02:34.860 --> 02:37.440
<i>Even if I'm all alone,</i>

02:37.530 --> 02:39.450
<i>no matter what form it takes,</i>

02:40.450 --> 02:43.410
<i>I'll play soccer in a way
that I can win.</i>

02:49.080 --> 02:51.420
<i>I'm not going to lose in a place like this.</i>

02:52.130 --> 02:55.590
<i>I'm not their toy.</i>

02:55.670 --> 02:58.880
<i>I'm not someone who's satisfied
with what's given to me.</i>

02:59.470 --> 03:03.100
<i>Until I can prove that I can obtain
what I want with my own hands,</i>

03:04.180 --> 03:06.310
I cannot lose!

03:07.310 --> 03:09.480
Are you that afraid of losing?

03:09.560 --> 03:11.940
You damn rich snob.

03:12.020 --> 03:16.480
I will personally hand you your first defeat!

03:16.570 --> 03:17.990
<i>This guy again!</i>

03:18.070 --> 03:21.990
<i>Because of him, my passing lanes
to Nagi have become extremely narrow.</i>

03:22.070 --> 03:25.030
<i>We can't easily overlap from the opposite flank either.</i>

03:25.120 --> 03:29.120
<i>I want to get rid of this pervert. But</i>

03:29.200 --> 03:32.250
<i>number 11 is waiting for a chance
to steal the ball.</i>

03:32.960 --> 03:34.960
<i>If I force it, I'll lose possession.</i>

03:35.040 --> 03:37.130
<i>I don't want them to counter.</i>

03:37.710 --> 03:40.300
<i>But what can I do?</i>

03:41.840 --> 03:46.720
<i>This pitch is completely controlled
by Team Z.</i>

03:47.850 --> 03:48.850
I...

03:49.600 --> 03:52.600
Are Nagi and I going to lose?

03:55.480 --> 03:56.480
Reo.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.320
Pass it to me.

04:01.400 --> 04:02.400
Nagi.

04:05.410 --> 04:06.780
<i>What happened to him?</i>

04:06.870 --> 04:09.910
<i>Did he just take the initiative for the first time?</i>

04:10.000 --> 04:12.500
Reo. I'm going to try.

04:13.330 --> 04:14.380
<i>Nagi.</i>

04:16.420 --> 04:17.630
What's going on all of a sudden?

04:17.710 --> 04:19.670
Could this guy actually dribble?

04:21.170 --> 04:22.340
<i>A chip?</i>

04:25.340 --> 04:27.760
<i>Did he distract me with a feint?</i>

04:27.850 --> 04:29.140
It's on you, Imamura!

04:29.970 --> 04:30.970
Got it!

04:34.100 --> 04:35.480
<i>A pass to the wing?</i>

04:40.190 --> 04:42.490
<i>Shit! He reacted faster than me!</i>

04:42.570 --> 04:43.700
That's it! Press them!

04:43.780 --> 04:47.780
<i>Did his movements change the dynamic of Team V?</i>

04:47.870 --> 04:50.410
Zantetsu. I'm expecting a cross.

04:50.490 --> 04:54.040
That's the first time you've ever asked me for something.

04:54.830 --> 04:56.830
Nagi, you...

04:58.040 --> 05:00.840
<i>I wonder why I'm putting in so much effort.</i>

05:02.010 --> 05:03.920
<i>Is it because of the look on Reo's face?</i>

05:04.930 --> 05:05.760
Stop him!

05:05.840 --> 05:09.050
<i>Is it because he felt defeat for the first time?</i>

05:09.640 --> 05:11.020
<i>Or...</i>

05:11.100 --> 05:12.470
I won't allow it!

05:13.810 --> 05:14.940
<i>Did he turn back?</i>

05:15.730 --> 05:20.020
<i>Have these troublemakers started
to look cool to me?</i>

05:20.860 --> 05:24.780
<i>But it's too late now, he's already awakened.</i>

05:26.110 --> 05:29.280
<i>I can't stop this curiosity.</i>

05:29.830 --> 05:30.870
No way!

05:30.950 --> 05:32.700
He can't shoot from that angle!

05:32.790 --> 05:34.410
<i>I want to challenge myself</i>

05:35.160 --> 05:36.710
<i>through soccer!</i>

05:37.000 --> 05:41.170
<i>In that case, we weren't the only ones
who underwent an awakening.</i>

05:42.840 --> 05:44.670
<i>This monster has awoken too!</i>

05:45.670 --> 05:48.050
-That's it!
-Nagi!

05:48.140 --> 05:49.140
Hell yeah!

05:49.890 --> 05:51.890
Nagi! You...

05:52.470 --> 05:53.520
Look, Reo.

05:54.140 --> 05:56.730
Soccer is actually really fun.

05:58.350 --> 06:01.320
<i>My life was nothing but boredom.</i>

06:02.730 --> 06:05.030
<i>Until I discovered this ego</i>

06:05.610 --> 06:06.820
<i>called 'curiosity'.</i>

06:08.610 --> 06:09.910
How many more should I score?

06:10.820 --> 06:13.450
-That's it! We can win!
<i>-This is fine.</i>

06:14.080 --> 06:16.960
<i>This way I can survive.</i>

06:17.620 --> 06:19.250
We're completely finished!

06:21.750 --> 06:25.800
Nobody told us he could create plays.

06:25.880 --> 06:28.880
<i>The weight of this goal is immense.</i>

06:28.970 --> 06:30.260
<i>At a moment like this...</i>

06:30.890 --> 06:35.470
<i>No, precisely because it was such a moment,
we awakened him.</i>

06:36.310 --> 06:41.060
<i>The hidden potential inside
the genius named Nagi Seishiro.</i>

06:42.310 --> 06:46.110
<i>So we weren't the only ones
who underwent an awakening!</i>

06:46.780 --> 06:49.450
Shit! We've only got
15 minutes left!

06:49.530 --> 06:52.450
What do we do? How can we stop him?

06:52.530 --> 06:56.330
Kunigami, can you drop back
and help defend?

06:56.410 --> 06:57.410
Okay.

06:57.870 --> 07:00.540
If they score one more, it's definitely over.

07:00.620 --> 07:03.710
In this situation, we should play defensively
and look for a counter opportunity-

07:03.790 --> 07:05.170
Are you idiots!

07:05.250 --> 07:06.880
Attack, you shitbags!

07:06.960 --> 07:09.590
Attack, attack, and attack some more!

07:09.680 --> 07:12.470
Me and this loser will handle
the midfield somehow!

07:12.550 --> 07:14.100
-Raichi.
-You guys attack!

07:14.180 --> 07:16.520
What's the point of playing defensively from now on?

07:17.350 --> 07:20.810
If we don't turn it around in 15 minutes,
it's over for us!

07:20.890 --> 07:23.020
Our attacks are working!

07:23.110 --> 07:27.730
The reason we've scored 3 goals so far,
even though I didn't want to,

07:27.820 --> 07:29.280
was because I stayed back on defense!

07:29.360 --> 07:32.280
If you waste my effort, I'll kill all of you!

07:32.360 --> 07:33.820
Attack to the death!

07:33.910 --> 07:35.120
All of you go, idiots!

07:35.200 --> 07:38.250
Aren't you all forwards?

07:39.000 --> 07:41.870
TIME REMAINING IN THE MATCH

07:42.960 --> 07:44.880
One last one, Nagi.

07:44.960 --> 07:47.670
If we score one more, we win.

07:47.750 --> 07:49.170
Just one?

07:49.260 --> 07:50.380
That's it?

07:51.720 --> 07:53.010
You're right.

07:53.090 --> 07:56.310
We have no choice but to attack.

07:56.890 --> 07:57.930
<i>I'll score the goal!</i>

08:00.730 --> 08:04.190
<i>But to score, I'm still missing something.</i>

08:04.690 --> 08:09.070
<i>The one who smells the goal the most right now
is undoubtedly</i>

08:09.690 --> 08:10.780
<i>Nagi!</i>

08:10.860 --> 08:14.305
<i>After he started moving of his own will,
how can I stop him?</i>

08:16.530 --> 08:19.160
<i>Bachira? He's looking for someone to pass to.</i>

08:19.240 --> 08:20.620
<i>I see.</i>

08:20.700 --> 08:23.120
<i>We're all just running around.</i>

08:23.210 --> 08:26.250
<i>The opponent got fired up from that last goal,</i>

08:26.340 --> 08:29.210
<i>and Bachira is naturally tired.</i>

08:29.300 --> 08:30.590
<i>What should we do?</i>

08:30.670 --> 08:32.170
<i>What can I possibly do?</i>

08:32.760 --> 08:35.640
<i>What can I do to make us win?</i>

08:35.720 --> 08:37.600
Crush them from the wing, Chigiri.

08:38.640 --> 08:39.810
Got it, leave it to me!

08:40.600 --> 08:42.020
Bring it on, redhead.

08:42.100 --> 08:43.850
I'll stop you this time.

08:43.940 --> 08:45.480
I'll clear my reading.

08:45.560 --> 08:48.520
That's 'honor', you stupid four-eyes!

08:49.320 --> 08:50.860
<i>He's better than me at acceleration.</i>

08:51.490 --> 08:54.530
<i>But in total speed, I'm superior!</i>

08:54.610 --> 08:56.660
<i>No matter how many times, I'll pass you!</i>

08:58.410 --> 09:01.040
Nice play, stupid Zantetsu.

09:01.120 --> 09:04.000
<i>Seriously? Did he predict it?</i>

09:04.080 --> 09:05.870
I'll take it, princess.

09:05.960 --> 09:07.710
You're quite naive, Mr. Genius!

09:07.790 --> 09:09.800
If you're going to steal the ball, stop right there!

09:09.880 --> 09:11.170
Isagi.

09:11.260 --> 09:15.050
<i>Even if I can't read his movements,
I can read the field.</i>

09:15.720 --> 09:20.180
<i>To get past Zantetsu, Chigiri is likely
to kick the ball far ahead.</i>

09:20.260 --> 09:23.350
<i>But the time it takes for Chigiri
to reach the ball,</i>

09:23.430 --> 09:25.140
<i>that's his weak point.</i>

09:25.230 --> 09:29.940
<i>If I run to where the ball will land,
the weak spot on the field disappears.</i>

09:30.020 --> 09:31.579
<i>I won't let them stop</i>

09:32.480 --> 09:33.780
<i>your legs!</i>

09:36.610 --> 09:38.700
Good job, Isagi.

09:38.780 --> 09:40.586
I'll deal with you properly later.

09:40.870 --> 09:41.776
Shit, he's too fast!

09:41.830 --> 09:43.370
Stop him in the penalty area!

09:43.450 --> 09:45.120
-Okay!
-We have enough bodies!

09:45.210 --> 09:48.080
What do you mean enough bodies? Everywhere

09:48.750 --> 09:49.920
is wide open!

09:53.420 --> 09:55.300
-Dude!
-The post?

09:55.380 --> 09:56.760
<i>No, it's not over yet.</i>

09:57.380 --> 10:00.550
<i>The defense gathered on the left
due to Chigiri's pressure,</i>

10:00.640 --> 10:05.180
<i>leaving the right side open,
where the wild one who can shoot from anywhere</i>

10:05.770 --> 10:06.770
<i>Gagamaru is there!</i>

10:09.190 --> 10:10.560
Shit. You...

10:10.650 --> 10:12.270
Can't we score again?

10:12.360 --> 10:14.780
<i>No, that area</i>

10:15.320 --> 10:18.200
<i>is his territory!</i>

10:18.280 --> 10:20.160
I'll destroy all of you.

10:20.240 --> 10:21.990
Continuous attack!

10:28.210 --> 10:29.416
<i>Just as I predicted!</i>

10:30.290 --> 10:32.710
Shit!

10:32.790 --> 10:36.170
-Hell yeah!
-Hell yeah!

10:36.260 --> 10:39.340
<i>Did that really just happen?
Exactly as I predicted.</i>

10:40.840 --> 10:43.140
<i>Why did it turn out like this?</i>

10:44.770 --> 10:49.520
<i>The moment Bachira passed to Chigiri,
in the simulation that formed in my head,</i>

10:49.600 --> 10:52.440
<i>the place I ran to was the weak spot.</i>

10:53.190 --> 10:55.980
<i>If I can fill that gap,</i>

10:56.070 --> 10:58.740
<i>I can pave the way for our continuous attacks.</i>

10:59.400 --> 11:01.280
<i>That's how I mapped it in my head.</i>

11:02.280 --> 11:04.053
<i>Assessing my team's weapons,</i>

11:04.146 --> 11:08.080
<i>and mapping the field in my head
according to the flow of the match,</i>

11:08.160 --> 11:11.170
<i>was possible because of my spatial awareness ability.</i>

11:12.130 --> 11:15.170
<i>I see. I can use it this way.</i>

11:15.960 --> 11:19.930
<i>With these eyes and this brain,
I can foresee the future of the pitch!</i>

11:20.550 --> 11:23.890
<i>With this power, I will score my own goal!</i>

11:33.770 --> 11:36.320
Great! We've gathered 11 people!

11:36.400 --> 11:39.860
The Kitsunezaka High School soccer team
starts from today!

11:39.950 --> 11:41.780
Our goal is the national championship!

11:41.860 --> 11:43.990
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

11:44.070 --> 11:45.780
Hey, Kuon, you're aiming too high.

11:45.870 --> 11:49.330
If we're aiming, go professional,
then national championship!

11:49.410 --> 11:50.620
Push forward!

11:50.710 --> 11:52.040
Nice pass, Kuon!

11:53.330 --> 11:54.380
That's it!

11:55.460 --> 11:58.760
<i>At first, I just wanted to play soccer.</i>

11:59.800 --> 12:02.720
Really? Honestly, there's no way.

12:02.800 --> 12:04.953
-He keeps saying the same thing.
-Hey, you're late!

12:04.990 --> 12:06.650
Don't skip morning practice!

12:06.710 --> 12:07.930
Sorry.

12:08.010 --> 12:10.100
What were you doing in that position?

12:10.180 --> 12:12.390
We can't go to nationals like this!

12:12.480 --> 12:16.860
MAMEDANUKI
KITSUNEZAKA

12:16.940 --> 12:18.020
Good job.

12:18.110 --> 12:18.940
I'm exhausted!

12:19.030 --> 12:20.360
I'm hungry.

12:21.400 --> 12:23.200
Aren't you guys upset at all?

12:23.280 --> 12:26.830
Aren't we going to nationals?
Don't you want to win with this team?

12:27.990 --> 12:29.830
Seriously?

12:29.910 --> 12:31.410
So ambitious.

12:33.040 --> 12:34.710
What's wrong with you guys?

12:34.790 --> 12:39.380
Didn't we say we'd go to nationals
and join the National Team?

12:39.460 --> 12:41.170
No way.

12:41.260 --> 12:44.340
You're the only one who's serious about this.

12:44.430 --> 12:47.350
And with a weak team like this,
going to nationals is just...

12:47.430 --> 12:49.060
You watch too much anime.

12:49.140 --> 12:52.060
We were quarterfinalists in the regionals.

12:52.140 --> 12:53.520
Isn't that enough?

12:53.600 --> 12:54.640
Let's go to karaoke!

12:54.730 --> 12:55.940
Yeah, for real.

12:57.060 --> 12:58.690
You're too serious, Kuon.

12:58.770 --> 13:01.610
Playing soccer with you
isn't fun at all.

13:02.320 --> 13:03.490
You're too slow.

13:04.030 --> 13:05.360
I don't need any of this.

13:05.450 --> 13:06.950
Sorry, let's just go.

13:07.030 --> 13:11.290
<i>In the end, I was the only one
who took it seriously.</i>

13:14.000 --> 13:15.000
<i>It doesn't matter anymore.</i>

13:15.790 --> 13:19.630
<i>I no longer need friends.</i>

13:20.420 --> 13:23.510
YOU HAVE BEEN SELECTED
TO BECOME A CERTIFIED ATHLETE

13:23.590 --> 13:26.260
<i>There are people who accept me.</i>

13:26.890 --> 13:30.100
<i>This must be the place where I'll fight.</i>

13:30.810 --> 13:34.600
<i>Even if I'm all alone!</i>

13:40.650 --> 13:42.320
<i>Despite being down to 10 players,</i>

13:43.740 --> 13:47.780
<i>Team Z continues to maximize their weapons,</i>

13:47.860 --> 13:51.540
<i>dominating the midfield and building attacks.</i>

13:52.290 --> 13:54.410
<i>Against them, Team V</i>

13:54.500 --> 13:58.750
<i>keeps attacking with Nagi Seishiro's unexpected awakening.</i>

13:58.830 --> 14:00.960
<i>I wouldn't be surprised no matter who wins.</i>

14:01.040 --> 14:03.670
<i>The next goal will determine the match's fate.</i>

14:03.760 --> 14:04.760
<i>But</i>

14:05.550 --> 14:07.380
<i>if they end up drawing,</i>

14:07.470 --> 14:10.600
<i>Team Z will drop to 3rd place and be eliminated.</i>

14:10.680 --> 14:15.270
<i>In that case, the team's top scorer
can survive and advance.</i>

14:15.980 --> 14:19.480
<i>Right now, I have 3 goals. But</i>

14:19.560 --> 14:23.360
<i>with that last one, Kunigami also reached 3 goals.</i>

14:23.940 --> 14:27.240
<i>And both of us have zero penalty points.</i>

14:27.320 --> 14:30.910
<i>In this case, whoever is higher
in the BL rankings</i>

14:30.990 --> 14:32.280
<i>will survive.</i>

14:32.870 --> 14:35.500
<i>So I will win!</i>

14:36.080 --> 14:38.290
<i>So I just need to stand still.</i>

14:38.790 --> 14:42.500
<i>If I do nothing and just stand here,
I can survive.</i>

14:43.590 --> 14:44.920
<i>This is fine.</i>

14:47.720 --> 14:51.140
<i>This is 'fine'.</i>

14:52.970 --> 14:54.810
Push up, Zantetsu. It's time for a counter.

14:55.850 --> 14:57.480
I'll stop you!

14:57.560 --> 14:59.560
Too bad, red-haired princess.

14:59.640 --> 15:01.020
We now have...

15:01.100 --> 15:02.980
<i>A long ball counter?</i>

15:03.060 --> 15:05.190
a freshly awakened genius!

15:05.280 --> 15:06.990
-He passed to Nagi!
-Get back!

15:07.070 --> 15:09.700
If they score one more, we're really done for!

15:09.780 --> 15:11.740
Good job, Zantetsu. You saw that well.

15:11.820 --> 15:12.950
Is this the spot?

15:13.910 --> 15:16.490
Right now, it's the weak point on the field.

15:17.660 --> 15:20.710
You can't escape from me!

15:20.790 --> 15:22.420
We haven't seen each other in a while.

15:22.500 --> 15:24.630
Nice, Isagi. Stop him!

15:24.710 --> 15:27.090
If he gets past you, he'll be one-on-one with the keeper!

15:27.170 --> 15:28.170
<i>No.</i>

15:28.260 --> 15:32.140
<i>He'll probably reach the ball before me.</i>

15:32.720 --> 15:36.560
<i>Even if I try to block him, he'll likely slip past me.</i>

15:37.560 --> 15:41.310
<i>So what I need to do is keep my distance,</i>

15:41.390 --> 15:44.770
<i>and buy time until my teammates arrive!</i>

15:45.980 --> 15:47.530
<i>I caught up!</i>

15:47.610 --> 15:48.860
<i>The secret is in the first touch!</i>

15:48.940 --> 15:51.070
<i>Right foot? Or left?</i>

15:51.150 --> 15:52.490
<i>Bring it on.</i>

15:52.570 --> 15:53.780
<i>I won't let you through!</i>

15:58.200 --> 15:59.700
<i>With his back?</i>

15:59.790 --> 16:01.670
<i>I never even considered it.</i>

16:02.460 --> 16:05.090
<i>He passed me in an instant. The situation is bad.</i>

16:06.040 --> 16:07.050
<i>We're seriously screwed!</i>

16:07.130 --> 16:12.010
I won't become someone
who couldn't realize their dream.

16:12.090 --> 16:17.470
<i>It's over! We'll be defeated by this monster's creativity!</i>

16:17.560 --> 16:23.980
Even if I end up all alone, no matter what method I use...

16:25.270 --> 16:30.940
-Stop!
-Stop!

16:35.320 --> 16:36.830
<i>Everything</i>

16:38.490 --> 16:39.700
<i>will be torn apart.</i>

16:50.170 --> 16:52.050
<i>Team Z, foul.</i>

16:52.130 --> 16:55.760
<i>Red card for deliberately stopping
a goal-scoring opportunity with a foul,</i>

16:56.430 --> 16:58.390
<i>Kuon Wataru.</i>

16:58.470 --> 16:59.470
<i>Leave the pitch.</i>

16:59.560 --> 17:02.730
-Kuon, what are you doing?
-Oh man.

17:03.940 --> 17:06.730
This way, you can still continue, right?

17:07.810 --> 17:08.940
Are you okay, Nagi?

17:08.986 --> 17:10.888
-Are you kidding me?
-Stop him!

17:10.913 --> 17:11.873
What was that just now?

17:11.940 --> 17:13.860
Reo. I'm okay.

17:13.950 --> 17:15.660
-But…
-Calm down, Reo!

17:15.740 --> 17:18.870
If you get one more yellow card,
you'll be sent off too.

17:19.910 --> 17:21.160
You bastards.

17:21.790 --> 17:23.500
What kind of plan was that?

17:23.580 --> 17:26.460
How should I know? We should be the ones asking.

17:27.080 --> 17:27.960
Hey, Kuon.

17:28.040 --> 17:30.500
If you had done nothing,
you would have survived anyway.

17:30.590 --> 17:31.670
What was that for?

17:32.630 --> 17:33.800
Nothing.

17:33.880 --> 17:36.630
It was something I did for myself.

17:37.930 --> 17:38.970
Kuon.

17:39.680 --> 17:43.770
But aren't you and Kunigami
tied with 3 goals?

17:43.850 --> 17:45.730
So with this red card,

17:45.810 --> 17:48.100
you got penalty points and fell behind.

17:48.190 --> 17:50.610
So if the match ends like this,

17:50.690 --> 17:54.320
Kuon-chan will also be eliminated along with us.

17:56.240 --> 17:57.240
Shut up.

17:57.780 --> 17:59.280
We probably know that already.

18:00.780 --> 18:01.950
I know, but...

18:03.830 --> 18:05.250
Anyway,

18:06.000 --> 18:07.210
you must win.

18:07.790 --> 18:10.710
After all, I'm the one who will become
the best in the world.

18:12.420 --> 18:16.170
Stop being ridiculous, Kuon. That's already decided.

18:16.260 --> 18:18.890
We're the ones who will win!

18:18.970 --> 18:20.850
I'm the one who will become the best in the world.

18:20.930 --> 18:22.100
No, it's me!

18:22.680 --> 18:24.430
It's not going to end in a place like this!

18:26.940 --> 18:28.810
Nagi, are you in pain?

18:28.900 --> 18:30.520
No, I'm fine.

18:30.610 --> 18:32.150
3 minutes left.

18:32.230 --> 18:33.780
Hey, Reo. How are we defending?

18:33.860 --> 18:35.740
Let's pass the ball around and waste time.

18:36.490 --> 18:37.610
What are you talking about?

18:37.700 --> 18:38.860
-What?
-What?

18:40.370 --> 18:42.280
We're going to crush them.

18:42.830 --> 18:46.620
Pulling back against these guys
is the same as losing.

18:46.700 --> 18:49.250
One more goal.

18:49.330 --> 18:52.630
They're not the only ones
who won't let it end like this.

18:59.510 --> 19:03.470
<i>A free kick from about 20 meters,
slightly to the right of the penalty area.</i>

19:04.260 --> 19:06.640
<i>If we screw up in the remaining short time,</i>

19:06.720 --> 19:08.799
<i>-we'll have no chance of winning.</i>
-Don't commit a foul!

19:08.870 --> 19:10.972
-Defend to the death!
<i>-Everyone is aware of the situation.</i>

19:11.310 --> 19:15.070
<i>Kuon created this situation.</i>

19:16.570 --> 19:20.200
<i>There's still a bit of time left
from what should have ended.</i>

19:21.110 --> 19:22.620
<i>No matter what, I'll...</i>

19:22.700 --> 19:24.410
<i>I'll definitely save it!</i>

19:24.490 --> 19:25.790
<i>Think!</i>

19:25.870 --> 19:27.330
<i>If I were Reo,</i>

19:27.410 --> 19:29.160
<i>even though he's marked,</i>

19:29.210 --> 19:31.263
<i>would I pass to Nagi, who can make something happen?</i>

19:31.290 --> 19:34.540
<i>Or pretend to do that and pass to Zantetsu?</i>

19:34.630 --> 19:37.710
<i>Which one? Which one will he pass to?</i>

19:38.970 --> 19:42.260
<i>No, this is Blue Lock!</i>

19:44.550 --> 19:45.430
Seriously?

19:45.510 --> 19:46.390
He didn't pass?

19:46.470 --> 19:49.680
<i>If he's an egoist, he'll shoot it himself!</i>

19:50.980 --> 19:52.150
I got it!

19:52.230 --> 19:53.443
-Get the ball!
-Nice, Iemon!

19:55.570 --> 19:57.480
<i>Shit! This guy is fast!</i>

20:00.740 --> 20:02.280
Where did you come from?

20:02.360 --> 20:04.320
From the wall, where else!

20:04.410 --> 20:06.160
-Get the ball!
-You touch it first!

20:10.040 --> 20:12.330
One more goal.

20:12.960 --> 20:14.790
Stop them!

20:27.470 --> 20:28.600
It's not over yet!

20:32.020 --> 20:33.230
Did he clear it?

20:34.850 --> 20:38.320
What the hell? What's really going on here?

20:38.900 --> 20:41.190
Their opponents are the undefeated Team V.

20:41.780 --> 20:44.070
And they're playing with 10 men.

20:45.030 --> 20:48.530
Maybe they really can win.

20:51.960 --> 20:55.040
Push forward, Isagi!

20:55.120 --> 20:57.750
This is our last chance.

22:29.590 --> 22:31.970
<i>Blue Lock, Extra Time.</i>

22:33.010 --> 22:38.900
'On the field, I am the king. You losers.'

22:38.980 --> 22:40.310
It doesn't look like him at all!

22:40.400 --> 22:41.360
KUNIGAMI RENSUKE

22:41.440 --> 22:43.150
Is this supposed to be Barou?

22:43.230 --> 22:44.110
ISAGI YOICHI

22:44.190 --> 22:46.190
No matter who you try to imitate, you're always Gagamaru.

22:46.280 --> 22:51.200
Alright! Then you're next in the 'Who Am I' championship, Isagi.

22:51.280 --> 22:56.120
'Natto is good stuff. I always get the pickled radish though.'

22:56.200 --> 22:57.250
-Igaguri!
-Igaguri!

22:57.330 --> 22:59.870
Correct! Amen!

22:59.960 --> 23:02.420
Okay, I'm doing the last one.

23:02.500 --> 23:04.300
We've been waiting for you, hero.

23:04.380 --> 23:06.340
Let's go! No one can hold you back!

23:11.180 --> 23:12.260
Huh? Who's this?

23:13.050 --> 23:14.720
That's Niko after he lost to us.

23:14.810 --> 23:16.520
Where do you find these things?

23:16.600 --> 23:17.560
So cute!

23:17.640 --> 23:19.190
Adorable.

23:19.270 --> 23:20.690
I could just eat you up.